# DOKS promote-from-stage (F30 / ADR-034)

## Environments

| `env_role` | Branch | DO Project | Cluster | Namespace | Hosts |
|------------|--------|------------|---------|-----------|-------|
| `staging` | `stage` | Staging TAC-to-IWXXM | `metar-iwxxm-staging` | `metar-iwxxm-staging` | `api\|app.staging.tac-to-iwxxm.com` |
| `prod` | `main` | TAC-to-IWXXM | `metar-iwxxm` | `metar-iwxxm` | `api\|app.tac-to-iwxxm.com` |

Do not label staging URLs as production. After EV-044, staging and prod are separate DOKS
clusters (not only namespaces). Use env-scoped kubeconfigs.

## Promote path

1. Feature → PR → `stage` (required CI).
2. Merge to `stage` → auto Deploy staging cluster after full Deploy `needs` (incl.
   `e2e-smoke`) + Staging smoke (HTTPS or Host-header via staging LB
   `143.244.202.13` / `STAGING_LB_IP`) + TestPyPI for packages that changed (`{CalVer}+test`).
3. Release prep on `stage` (recommended before every promote): cut `docs/CHANGELOG.md`.
   CalVer may be applied on `stage` or by CD ([Corpus: adr/ADR-043]).
4. Promote: PR `stage` → `main` only. CI Staging gate (`staging-gate`) must pass
   (head=`stage` + tip Staging smoke green). No feature→`main`. EV-061 / #1015: also
   require `Lint`, `Typecheck`, full `Test (*)`, and `E2E Full (Playwright)` (not smoke-only).
   See [Corpus: deploy] §Promote table and `scripts/deploy/apply_gh_branch_rulesets.sh`.
5. Merge to `main` → full CI then prod CD (DOKS + GHCR + one GitHub Release + PyPI tags
   for packages that changed). Docs-only or infra-only: DOKS + GHCR + Release; skip PyPI.
6. Manual redeploy: `workflow_dispatch` → production. Do not use `v*-deploy` tags.

Never push directly to `stage`/`main` when rulesets are enabled. Solo-dev gate: PR
`stage`→`main` (main CD ships). No Environment reviewers. Do not promote while Staging
smoke or Staging gate is red or missing (or while #1015 required checks are red or missing on
the promote PR).

## Release on promote

Every `stage` → `main` promote is a release (DOKS + GHCR + packages in one CD run):

| Step | When | Action |
|------|------|--------|
| CHANGELOG | On `stage`, before promote PR | Move Unreleased bullets into a dated section; note promote PR |
| CalVer / PyPI | After merge to `main` + tip CI green | CD bumps CalVer for **changed** packages, creates `{pkg}-v{version}` → `pypi-publish.yml`; same-day `.N` auto-bump ([Corpus: adr/ADR-043]) |
| GitHub Release | Same main CD | One Release `vYYYY.M.D[.N]` with digests + package list |
| TestPyPI | On `stage` CD | Changed packages as `{CalVer}+test` |

Docs-only / infra-only promotes with **no** package tree changes skip PyPI tags but still
get DOKS + GHCR + GitHub Release.

Details: [docs/deploy.md](../../docs/deploy.md) §Promote · skill
`pypi-release-checklist` · [Corpus: product §F12–F14].

## Secrets

Staging `DATABASE_URL` must use dedicated Postgres `metar-iwxxm-staging` (EV-044) — never
prod `metar-iwxxm` / `defaultdb`. Do not copy prod secrets into staging ConfigMaps/docs.

